#: ../../../source/Releases/Galactic-Geochelone-Complete-Changelog.rst:406
msgid ""
"Fix skipped test reporting in CTest (`#279 <https://github.com/ament/"
"ament_cmake/issues/279>`__) This is a follow-up to c67cdf2. When the "
"SKIP_RETURN_CODE gets set to 0, the value is interpreted as 'false', and the "
"test property is never actually added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Galactic-Geochelone-Complete-Changelog.rst:407
msgid ""
"limit test time to three decimals (`#271 <https://github.com/ament/"
"ament_cmake/issues/271>`__)"
